    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32002" root="غضن" body-key="g">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغضنت السَّمَآءُ</span></b>  <i>The sky rained continually;</i>
(S, TA;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غضنت</span> [perhaps ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَضَنَت</span></b> , but
more probably, I think, ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَضَّنَت</span></b> ] (TA.) And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غضنت السَّحَابَةُ</span> [<i>The (??) continually</i>].
(S and TA in explanation of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَيَّمَت</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغضن عَلَيْهِ الحُمَّى</span> <i>The fever continued upon him
persistently.</i> (IAar, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغضن عَلَيْهِ اللَّيْلُ</span>
<i>The night became dark upon him.</i> (TA.)

